  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Follow up / reserve GPDRR 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Platform for Disaster Risk Reduction is the most important international conference to discuss progress in the implementation of the Sendai Framework for DRR. The eighth session of the Global Platform will be hosted by Switzerland in Geneva in June 2025. It will review advances in the realisation of the calls to action made in 2023 by the United Nations General Assembly on the midterm review of the Sendai Framework and will be key for the identification and support of measures to accelerate DRR implementation and improve coherence with the Agenda 2030 and the Paris Agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
